<h1 nodeId="072d6f648e154249a4b742529a94db56">流程总览</h1>
<km-drawio src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1426173682/10997156571?contentType=0&amp;isNewContent=false" width="816" height="296" nodeId="827347e85bb648d79ffdf7e042a7f060" />
<h2 align="start" nodeId="a21e97f5985c41d28f8787c530f89126">1 数据源接入</h2>
<ul nodeId="c1bbdf5580574d03b4f82f5a7d40eb2e">
<li nodeId="eacc54bf1fb444d38bcac829c0b8826c"><strong>目的：确定该画布作业输入的数据来源。当前支持Kafka</strong><em><strong>、Mafka</strong></em><strong>消息接入</strong></li>
</ul>
