</td>
<td colwidth="[272]" nodeId="3e9ac6487a7e4fb7aa1089fc152373f8">
<p nodeId="08219e2402a64c8c9b629a164444c851"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1426173682/10997461591?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="207" height="600" nodeId="f633e74bc6344f98a148516d8130e2de" /></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[798]" nodeId="5085240e59b140efa070f8af9a71c876">
<p nodeId="0c4db56db51e419aa55828279d6d6455"><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200718382" title="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200718382" autoUpdate="true" nodeId="c41c4ac812ce4c2a9e086cecae5d1dc6">https://km.sankuai.com/page/1200718382</a></p>
<p nodeId="52c4daa49e3843b2bea2befbd44d1f07">示例<a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=47&amp;version=15" title="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=47&amp;version=15" nodeId="d0e697b830c448b3a14a9e13251064e8">https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=47&amp;version=15</a>组件1</p>
<p nodeId="24ffd99f83c740c09a476b499e91e57a">【配置相关】</p>
<ul nodeId="a6c474b75d574bd8a032de47ebbf88a7">
<li nodeId="a53b4bb595f448d0ae7aa0d89d9ac352">
<p nodeId="c3d3d538bc7a4c6faabdc9a10958fed8"><strong>Namespace/Topic</strong>填写用以确定选中某一数据源</p>
<ul nodeId="32351f8470b74f0995477c5e01d9b589">
<li nodeId="34a1693ee9224909bbb5104f078669c1">权限：填写完成后系统会自动校验配置者是否有该数据源权限，若无则需跳转至kafka平台进行权限申请<img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1426173682/10997461586?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="330" height="148" nodeId="c5a2d0f91572401d806975300f8ae3a7" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1426173682/10996814059?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="287" height="236" nodeId="9100cbd6be7740f79d3dba9200b206c8" /></li>
<li nodeId="3958732c3e3d4ef69b80cc55d325dee1">申请权限的需求方请填写为所在<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)">业务域对应的项目组</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li nodeId="abddd391a8374274ab2df90d9424ad2b">
<p nodeId="4a3af5a3e71d435fbbbb267f6df0a9ee"><strong>日志类型</strong>：如果json选择log或newlog格式直接配置即可；如果是特殊格式或者需要一对多转换，需要使用自定义数据源方式。</p>
<ul nodeId="91a9d1d13fa94161aa95a9462e77a3f5">
<li nodeId="877195f34009493a8f6093bc41fba929"><span color="">自定义数据源代码需要继承IParser抽象类，并实现parse方法；如果希望输出多条数据，需要继承IFlatParser抽象类，并实现flatParse方法</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li nodeId="26a65eb1bd7f44f498588b09f59ae81e">
<p align="start" nodeId="982f19a8528e4ea1835a606e504a9660"><strong>参数配置</strong>（高级配置）：当用户选择多个kafka 数据源时，可能存在不同数据源有相同的字段，在后面进行逻辑编写时可能存在字段重复导致逻辑配置有问题，所以可以在参数配置模块对topic里的字段进行重命名</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="d4be5082dbbf471194b4f1239abe97bf" />
</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="f43f527a22d74b7d9353e3f0954139da">
<td colwidth="[69]" bgColor="rgb(244, 245, 247)" nodeId="db340fed8f0f45578ab9ff7333227806">
<p nodeId="05388b7147024705afcb28345098f5ad">Mafka</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[272]" bgColor="rgb(244, 245, 247)" nodeId="be04c2ffd65c4ed396f2c0a2e65667fb">
<p nodeId="cdbc0d6cc0ef4c999e92a795e52f6b11" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[798]" bgColor="rgb(244, 245, 247)" nodeId="fb2d114442ab43ab94f6b1f3868970ed">
<p nodeId="7f5863bd018c4a58a1202c47a6ab036c">待上线功能</p>
<ul nodeId="65a250471d1a4f559ff248b5e24279d0">
<li nodeId="4daa687a5301480295abd1f02f6bedca">支持近线画布接入及输出mafka消息</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p align="start" nodeId="61696a82ef6245c4ab160c5ee15a39a1" />
<h2 align="start" nodeId="aebcdb5f56014a86bb818eeccbaa3370">2 数据源预处理</h2>
<ul nodeId="e15c6465b3824369b1034f0807fd3e58">
