<p nodeId="f22d33801a1e40d1a3c8f3d028591697">简单逻辑，可以用Select组件（aviator语法），exp-5支持比较复杂的语法</p>
<p nodeId="1627e3b5c9ea4a568ef81c6615ae04f2"><span color="">示例：</span><a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=47&amp;version=15" title="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=47&amp;version=15" nodeId="6a5084eb611846319a2717ccc8ce4cab">https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=47&amp;version=15</a><span color=""> 组件17</span></p>
