<p nodeId="a3c5d34cc9494d8db37ecd3e28ec343a">复杂逻辑，可以用代码组件（java语法）</p>
<p nodeId="fde64fafb0a54f85b4f9ac4f0d62158b"><span color="">示例 </span><a href="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=107&amp;version=11" title="https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=107&amp;version=11" nodeId="808fd98a792a4f44a86d80a90c77f281">https://zeus.sankuai.com/data_zeus_static/#/paint/detail?id=107&amp;version=11</a><span color=""> 组件26</span></p>
<p nodeId="d4434137570c4b52b3d8fc8cc3c4412e"><span color="">【常见使用场景】</span></p>
<ol nodeId="99246a8ab9344bd5b8dfbb0149b09c16">
<li nodeId="a54cbb92eadb48d0a240ad9e9f2e02fe">转化数据格式</li>
<li nodeId="e4b930c52f574add9972102133093def">进行数据增强</li>
<li nodeId="6b0df49858bb4d35afe28fba6bb5c526">其余各种自定义用途</li>
</ol>
<p nodeId="88e39bbecaf741339ba5c44c60b36a5e">【配置相关】</p>
<ul nodeId="dba552af705144a2a8027e94bd6b1c74">
<li nodeId="4c40af5cc020486794f529acf09b4887">选择返回一个值或返回多个值逻辑，选择后代码框中会出现提示代码</li>
</ul>
<ul nodeId="49175ccd5ca3462a85dff9ca9ee6df0a">
<li nodeId="c5526b0bbe294166a0d5cf59efef4e73">
<p align="start" nodeId="6c3a2c7abbf64568b6cc35f6dd2ce35d">如果要实现“返回一个值”的逻辑，则继承抽象类IProcessor，并实现process方法。</p>
</li>
<li nodeId="2caa80b4c7334092bbabeee72358b137">如果要实现“返回多个值”的逻辑，则继承抽象类IFlatProcessor，并实现flatProcess方法。</li>
<li nodeId="39a31ef1161148a2b9a31742bb5ec0a2">
<p align="start" nodeId="2ff2ee99602f4871bc9aaa7ce626e927">process方法入参为传入该组件的上下文，出参为经过该组件处理后的上下文。</p>
</li>
<li nodeId="7871141adb3344a99633f2bc314dfa45">
<p nodeId="f7063cafc6cf4b969f6c036a5c1a9ed9">flatProcess方法入参为传入该组件的上下文，出参为经过该组件处理后的多条上下文。</p>
<p align="start" nodeId="16fafbb5d877416a98aaefd3ffa6aa9f" />
</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
